# CloudConvert Documentation

> This is the documentation for the CloudConvert API.

## Docs

- [API Documentation](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/getting-started/introduction.md): Welcome to the CloudConvert API
- [Quickstart Guide](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/getting-started/quickstart-guide.md): A typical implementation flow for the CloudConvert API
- [Jobs](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/api-reference/jobs.md): Create, list, show, wait for and delete jobs.
- [Tasks](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/api-reference/tasks.md): Create, list, show, wait for, cancel, retry and delete tasks.
- [Operations](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/api-reference/operations.md): List all possible operations, formats, engines and possible options.
- [Users](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/api-reference/users.md): Show information about the current user and the remaining credits.
- [Webhooks](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/api-reference/webhooks.md): Create, list and delete webhooks.
- [Convert Files](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/convert-files.md): Convert files to different formats.
- [Optimize Files](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/optimize-files.md): Compress and optimize PDF, PNG and JPG files.
- [Add Watermarks](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/add-watermarks.md): Add a watermark to a PDF file, to an image (PNG, JPG...) or to a video (MP4, MOV...).
- [Capture Website](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/capture-website.md): Convert a website to PDF or capture a screenshot of a website (PNG, JPG).
- [Create Thumbnails](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/create-thumbnails.md): Create a PNG, JPG or WEBP thumbnail of input files.
- [Merge Files](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/merge-files.md): Combine multiple input files in one single PDF
- [PDF Operations](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/pdf-operations.md): Convert, optimize and manipulate PDF files
- [Create Archives](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/create-archives.md): Create a task to create a ZIP, RAR, 7Z, TAR, TAR.GZ or TAR.BZ2 archive.
- [File Metadata](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/file-metadata.md): Extract and write file metadata
- [Execute Commands](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/operations/execute-commands.md): Execute custom ffmpeg, imagemagick, and graphicsmagick commands.
- [Import Files](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/import-export/import-files.md): Import files to the CloudConvert service as input files for other operations
- [Export Files](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/import-export/export-files.md): Export files from the CloudConvert service to external storages or temporary download URLs
- [MCP Server](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/integrations/mcp-server.md): Use CloudConvert file processing tools from ChatGPT, Claude, and other MCP clients.
- [Signed URLs](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/integrations/signed-urls.md): Convert files on demand using URL query parameters.
- [Socket API](https://cloudconvert.com/docs/raw/integrations/socket.md): Real-time task updates using Socket.io.